{"words": [{"text": "يَكَادُ", "translation": "Almost"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَرْقُ", "translation": "the lightning"}, {"text": "يَخْطَفُ", "translation": "snatches away"}, {"text": "أَبْصَـٰرَهُمْ ۖ", "translation": "their sight"}, {"text": "كُلَّمَآ", "translation": "Whenever"}, {"text": "أَضَآءَ", "translation": "it flashes"}, {"text": "لَهُم", "translation": "for them"}, {"text": "مَّشَوْا۟", "translation": "they walk"}, {"text": "فِيهِ", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "وَإِذَآ", "translation": "and when"}, {"text": "أَظْلَمَ", "translation": "it darkens"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِمْ", "translation": "on them"}, {"text": "قَامُوا۟ ۚ", "translation": "they stand (still)"}, {"text": "وَلَوْ", "translation": "And if"}, {"text": "شَآءَ", "translation": "had willed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "لَذَهَبَ", "translation": "He would certainly have taken away"}, {"text": "بِسَمْعِهِمْ", "translation": "their hearing"}, {"text": "وَأَبْصَـٰرِهِمْ ۚ", "translation": "and their sight"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "(is) on"}, {"text": "كُلِّ", "translation": "every"}, {"text": "شَىْءٍۢ", "translation": "thing"}, {"text": "قَدِيرٌۭ", "translation": "All-Powerful"}], "sahih": "The lightning almost snatches away their sight. Every time it lights [the way] for them, they walk therein; but when darkness comes over them, they stand [still]. And if Allāh had willed, He could have taken away their hearing and their sight. Indeed, Allāh is over all things competent."}